flowchart TD
    A[Audio chunk received] --> B{Deepgram STT available?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Transcribe chunk]
    B -->|No - connection dropped| D[Pipecat reconnects]
    D -->|Reconnected| C
    D -->|Max retries| E[Log error, pipeline pauses]
    C --> F{LLM available?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Generate response]
    F -->|No - API error| H[Log error, skip turn]
    H --> I[Mic ungated - candidate can continue speaking]
    G --> J{TTS available?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Synthesize audio]
    J -->|No| L[Log error, no audio playback]
    L --> I

    style E fill:#fecaca,stroke:#ef4444
    style H fill:#fef9c3,stroke:#eab308
    style L fill:#fef9c3,stroke:#eab308
